        "html": "v_Ed ≤ ν f_cd / (cot θ_f + 1/cot θ_f), i.e. cot θ_f = (ρ + √(ρ² − 4))/2 with ρ = ν f_cd / v_Ed; this needs the least steel. ρ &lt; 2: cot θ_f = 1, strut fails.",
