    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27398,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "NOT DESIGNED AS COMPOSITE: the studs that fit cannot give composite action (η &lt; η_min,",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#b91c1c",
        "align": "left",
        "showWhen": "c_{comp}<1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27423,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "too few studs, or M_Rd(x) &lt; M_Ed(x), e.g. a large point load close to a support).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#b91c1c",
        "align": "left",
        "showWhen": "c_{comp}<1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27448,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Designed as a BARE STEEL beam (chapter 6, annex): EN 1993-1-1 and EN 1993-1-5 met by the steel",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#b91c1c",
        "align": "left",
        "showWhen": "c_{comp}<1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27473,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "alone; LTB length = stud spacing (top flange restrained, s ≤ s_max, EN 1994-1-1 §6.4.1(1), §6.6.5.5);",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#b91c1c",
        "align": "left",
        "showWhen": "c_{comp}<1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_to",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27498,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "UR uses the steel-alone deflection, not the composite one. If it fails, enlarge the section (Browse).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#b91c1c",
        "align": "left",
        "showWhen": "c_{comp}<1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27523,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "REVIEW DRAFT. If UR_LT &gt; 1, the bare beam needs temporary restraint or propping during construction.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27548,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Gates: Singapore NAs; shrinkage history and cracking; surfaces c-c/d-d, splitting and anchorage lengths.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
